    "detailed_description": "<i>...the best CryptoZoo on the market... the best of it's kind... the best there ever will be...</i><br><br><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD</strong><br><br>Keep up with any other game releases coming your way!<br><br><strong>THE GAME</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273210/extras/aed7071f79cd4cdb464b8a84755de742.avif?t=1676124105\" /></span><br>XD Tokens are a must have for any CryptoZoo-ologist. Use XD Tokens to crack eggs and collect animals. Merge them into new creations and sell high!<br>Hatch-Merge-Sell is the gameplay loop. Short on cash? Cannot afford to crack anymore eggs? Fear not! CryptoZoo includes a in-game mini game called Crypto Invaders to help you earn by playing the game!<br><br><strong>PLAY TO EARN</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273210/extras/ab06974c23301af81bdf250fa20e9393.avif?t=1676124105\" /></span><br>Destroy waves of Space Cryptos - the further you go. The more XD Tokens you will earn!<br><br><strong>THE DEVELOPER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273210/extras/265ecbb3607f238af4f1ed3dc95a3c11.avif?t=1676124105\" /></span><br>Coding video games is only a hobby. I work 40 hours a week in the trades. It brings me enjoyment. I love it. And I hope my game(s) bring you enjoyment too! That is what gaming it all about. Have fun :)",
    "about_the_game": "<i>...the best CryptoZoo on the market... the best of it's kind... the best there ever will be...</i><br><br><strong>JOIN THE DISCORD</strong><br><br>Keep up with any other game releases coming your way!<br><br><strong>THE GAME</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273210/extras/aed7071f79cd4cdb464b8a84755de742.avif?t=1676124105\" /></span><br>XD Tokens are a must have for any CryptoZoo-ologist. Use XD Tokens to crack eggs and collect animals. Merge them into new creations and sell high!<br>Hatch-Merge-Sell is the gameplay loop. Short on cash? Cannot afford to crack anymore eggs? Fear not! CryptoZoo includes a in-game mini game called Crypto Invaders to help you earn by playing the game!<br><br><strong>PLAY TO EARN</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273210/extras/ab06974c23301af81bdf250fa20e9393.avif?t=1676124105\" /></span><br>Destroy waves of Space Cryptos - the further you go. The more XD Tokens you will earn!<br><br><strong>THE DEVELOPER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273210/extras/265ecbb3607f238af4f1ed3dc95a3c11.avif?t=1676124105\" /></span><br>Coding video games is only a hobby. I work 40 hours a week in the trades. It brings me enjoyment. I love it. And I hope my game(s) bring you enjoyment too! That is what gaming it all about. Have fun :)",
